<doc id="26397" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=26397" title="Jalur Utama Meitetsu Nagoya">
Jalur Utama Meitetsu Nagoya

Jalur Utama Nagoya (名古屋本線, Nagoya Honsen&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;) nyaéta jalur &lt;a href="railway"&gt;kareta&lt;/a&gt; nu dioperasikeun ku &lt;a href="Nagoya%20Railroad"&gt;Nagoya Railroad&lt;/a&gt; (Meitetsu), antara &lt;a href="Toyohashi%20Station"&gt;Toyohashi Station&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Toyohashi%2C%20Aichi"&gt;Toyohashi City&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Stasion%20Meitetsu%20Gifu"&gt;Meitetsu Gifu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gifu%2C%20Gifu"&gt;Gifu&lt;/a&gt;. Sakabéh stasion bisa narima &lt;a href="Tranpass"&gt;Tranpass&lt;/a&gt;, kartu magnetik pra bayar.
<h2>Data dasar</h2>
<ul>
<li>Jarak: 99.8 &lt;a href="Kilometre"&gt;km&lt;/a&gt; / Approx. 62.0 &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="mile"&gt;mi.&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Jumlah Stasion: 60</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Rail%20gauge"&gt;Gauge&lt;/a&gt;: 1,067&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="Millimetre"&gt;mm&lt;/a&gt; / 3 &lt;a href="foot%20%28unit%20of%20length%29"&gt;ft.&lt;/a&gt; 6 &lt;a href="inch"&gt;in.&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Track:</li>
<ul>
<li>Jalur opat trek:</li>
<ul>
<li>Ti Jingū-mae ka Kanayama</li>
</ul>
<li>Jalur trek ganda:</li>
<ul>
<li>Ti Hirai Signal Box ka Jingū-mae</li>
<li>Ti Kanayama ka Kanō</li>
</ul>
<li>Jalur trek tunggal:</li>
<ul>
<li>Ti Toyohashi ka Hirai Signal Box (A shared track with JR Iida Line, virtually double-tracked.)</li>
