</ul>
</ul>
<li>Sumber listrik: Whole line (1,500&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="Volt"&gt;V&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="Direct%20current"&gt;DC&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
<li>Block system: Automatic</li>
<li>Maximum speed at service: 120 &lt;a href="Kilometres%20per%20hour"&gt;km/h&lt;/a&gt; (85 &lt;a href="Kilometres%20per%20hour"&gt;km/h&lt;/a&gt; between Toyohashi and Hirai Signal Box.)</li>
