Most overnight trains on the Tōkaidō Line go from Tokyo to western &lt;a href="Honsh%C5%AB"&gt;Honshū&lt;/a&gt;, or even as far as &lt;a href="Ky%C5%ABsh%C5%AB"&gt;Kyūshū&lt;/a&gt;.
