<doc id="26546" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=26546" title="Nozomi (Shinkansen)">
Nozomi (Shinkansen)

Nozomi (のぞみ, Nozomi&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;) nyaéta kareta panggancangna di jalur &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tōkaidō&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="Sany%C5%8D%20Shinkansen"&gt;Sanyō&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;. Manjang antara &lt;a href="Shin-Kobe%20station"&gt;Shin-Kobe&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Hakata%20station"&gt;Hakata&lt;/a&gt;, Nozomi ngagunakeun seri 500 nu kacepatanna ampir 300&amp;nbsp;km/jam (186&amp;nbsp;mph). Waktu antara &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt;, nu jauhna kilometer, ngan 2,5 jam maké Nozomi.
&lt;a href="300%20Series%20Shinkansen"&gt;300 Series Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="500%20Series%20Shinkansen"&gt;500 Series Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="700%20Series%20Shinkansen"&gt;700 Series Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="N700%20Series%20Shinkansen"&gt;N700 Series Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; kiwari dipaké keur layanan Nozomi. Panganyarna, N700, geus dipaké layanan Nozomi ti tanggal &lt;a href="1%20Juli"&gt;1 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, opat pp dina sapoe. Proyek ieu bakal ngaganti sakabéh layanan Nozomi (upamana Tokyo-Hakata) ku maké kareta N700 dina taun 2009, jeung sakabéh jadwal tetep layanan Nozomi bakal maké kareta N700 dina taun 2011.
Kareta ieu eureun leuwih saeutik tinimbang kareta &lt;a href="Hikari%20%28Shinkansen%29"&gt;Hikari&lt;/a&gt;. Dina Tōkaidō Shinkansen, Nozomi eureun di &lt;a href="Stasion%20Tokyo"&gt;Stasion Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stasion%20Nagoya"&gt;Stasion Nagoya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kyoto%20Station"&gt;Kyoto Station&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Shin-%C5%8Csaka%20Station"&gt;Shin-Ōsaka Station&lt;/a&gt;. Di jalur Sanyō, sakabéh kareta Nozomi eureun di &lt;a href="Shin-Kobe%20Station"&gt;Shin-Kobe Station&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Okayama%20Station"&gt;Okayama Station&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hiroshima%20Station"&gt;Hiroshima Station&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kokura%20Station"&gt;Kokura Station&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Hakata%20Station"&gt;Hakata Station&lt;/a&gt;. Aya ogé kareta Nozomi nu eureun di sababaraha stasion tambahan.
Nozomi ngan ngalayanan &lt;a href="Japan%20Railway"&gt;JR&lt;/a&gt; teu kaasup kana &lt;a href="Japan%20Rail%20Pass"&gt;Japan Rail Pass&lt;/a&gt;.
Kecap nozomi dina Basa Jepang hartina "harepan" atawa "wish". Kecap ieu dipilih saprak leuwih gancang ti layanan samemehna nyaéta &lt;a href="Hikari%20%28Shinkansen%29"&gt;Hikari&lt;/a&gt;, "cahaya, sinar", jeung &lt;a href="Kodama%20%28Shinkansen%29"&gt;Kodama&lt;/a&gt;, "sora".
Nozomi mimit dipaké dina tanggal &lt;a href="14%20Maret"&gt;14 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;.
