Stasion Ueno (上野駅, ueno-eki&lt;a href="Sistim%20tulis%20Jepang"&gt;?&lt;/a&gt;) nyaéta &lt;a href="stasion%20kareta"&gt;stasion kareta&lt;/a&gt; utama di ward &lt;a href="Taito%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Taitō&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;. Stasion ieu dipaké keur ngalayanan distrik &lt;a href="Ueno%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Ueno&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Ueno%20Park"&gt;Ueno Park&lt;/a&gt;—nu di jerona aya &lt;a href="Tokyo%20National%20Museum"&gt;Tokyo National Museum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20National%20Museum%20of%20Western%20Art"&gt;The National Museum of Western Art&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ueno%20Zoo"&gt;Ueno Zoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tokyo%20National%20University%20of%20Fine%20Arts%20and%20Music"&gt;Tokyo National University of Fine Arts and Music&lt;/a&gt; tur fasilitas budaya séjénna. Titik komuter utama, ogé terminal tradisional keur kareta jarak-jauh ti &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; beulah kaler, sanajan keur Jalur &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; nerus nepi ka &lt;a href="Stassion%20Tokyo"&gt;Stassion Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;. Padeukeut jeung &lt;a href="Keisei-Ueno%20Station"&gt;Keisei-Ueno Station&lt;/a&gt;, terminal Tokyo ti &lt;a href="Keisei%20Main%20Line"&gt;Keisei Main Line&lt;/a&gt; ka &lt;a href="Narita%20Airport%20Station"&gt;Narita Airport Station&lt;/a&gt;.
