<doc id="26639" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=26639" title="Yamagata Shinkansen">
Yamagata Shinkansen

Yamagata &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; (山形新幹線) nyaéta &lt;a href="Mini-Shinkansen"&gt;Mini-Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Honsh%C5%AB"&gt;Honshū&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, bagéan ti pausahaan &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;JR East&lt;/a&gt;. Ieu ngalayanan antara &lt;a href="Stasion%20Tokyo"&gt;Stasion Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Shinj%C5%8D%20Station"&gt;Shinjō Station&lt;/a&gt; (di kota &lt;a href="Shinj%C5%8D%2C%20Yamagata"&gt;Shinjō&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yamagata%20Prefecture"&gt;Yamagata Prefecture&lt;/a&gt;) dina trek &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dhoku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tōhoku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="%C5%8Cu%20Main%20Line"&gt;Ōu Main Line&lt;/a&gt;. Bagéan antara Fukushima ka Yamagata dibuka tanggal &lt;a href="1%20Juli"&gt;1 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;, diteruskeun nepi ka Shinjo, mimiti operasi dina tanggal &lt;a href="4%20D%C3%A9s%C3%A9mber"&gt;4 Désémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;. Watesan Yamagata Shinkansen nujul kana bagéan nu ngahubungkeun &lt;a href="Fukushima%20Station%20%28Fukushima%29"&gt;Fukushima Station&lt;/a&gt; (di kota &lt;a href="Fukushima%2C%20Fukushima"&gt;Fukushima&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fukushima%20Prefecture"&gt;Fukushima Prefecture&lt;/a&gt;) jeung Shinjō Station.
Kareta mawa tujuh gerbong, seri 400 jeung E3 masih dipaké. Antara Stasion Tokyo jeung Stasion Fukushima, kareta babarengan jeung kareta Yamabiko dina Tōhoku Shinkansen. Antara Fukushima jeung Shinjō, mibanda trek kareta sorangan.
